{"type":"message","id":"d78f17b0","parentId":"964fb460","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:44:43.951Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3510de06-30f4-49c6-af4d-701659b9c634.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3510de06-30f4-49c6-af4d-701659b9c634.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 19:44:42 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a5445544a0c3c434a4c8814d2, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a5445544a0c3c434a4c8814d2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 19:44 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3510de06-30f4-49c6-af4d-701659b9c634.jpg"}],"timestamp":1774784683948}}
