ection entirely, or if the word choice between \"mixture\" and \"mixing\" is what's actually being highlighted as the issue. I keep second-guessing myself on whether \"mixture\" is actually correct, but the previous analysis was clear that this was the error, so I'll stick with that and proceed with the correction.","thinkingSignature":"975ee6b5dfe2585d2e0482a315e925984267fed1836e1cb66abc6d16f152fa49"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3easdaqn4uqu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/382f873f-c289-41a9-8bfd-71a3d9ca7929.jpg /tmp/abstract_penguin.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":520,"cacheRead":49867,"cacheWrite":2234,"totalTokens":52748,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.000624,"cacheRead":0.0029920199999999997,"cacheWrite":0.0008377500000000001,"total":0.00449187}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774785494823,"responseId":"061846d7976c3651710134d0f0184cf4"}}
