{"type":"message","id":"106fb1f1","parentId":"857b3ddd","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:02:41.262Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The app secret is incorrect or the app credentials have changed. This means the app secret stored in openclaw.json is no longer valid. This might be because the app has been updated or the secret was changed.\n\nWithout a valid app secret, I can't manually refresh the token. The user needs to go through the OAuth authorization flow again.\n\nLet me tell the user about this situation and suggest they re-authorize the app. But the authorization card isn't appearing automatically, so there might be a deeper issue.\n\nActually, looking at the situation:\n1. The refresh token exists in keychain\n2. But the app credentials (appId/appSecret) stored in openclaw.json are invalid (app secret invalid)\n3. This means OpenClaw can't refresh the token automatically\n\nThe user needs to re-authorize. But the auth card isn't appearing. Let me try to trigger it differently.\n\nActually, looking at the `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` tool description: \"飞书批量授权工具，一次性授权应用已开通的所有用户权限。仅在用户明确要求'授权所有权限'、'一次性授权'时使用。\"\n\nThis suggests there's a way to do batch authorization. But when I tried it earlier, it said the account is missing appId/appSecret config. That makes sense now - the config exists but the secret is invalid.\n\nLet me think about another approach. \n\nWait - the user is saying they don't see the authorization card that should be automatically appearing. The system should be sending this when the token refresh fails, but it's not showing up. Maybe the gateway isn't properly handling the token refresh failure and automatically prompting for re-authorization. I should try checking the gateway logs to see what's actually happening when the token refresh fails.","thinkingSignature":"46055dc7368694d0dc65ea33a6429b98320e15a9067efd2dbdf803285498ffd0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5dho8zszz06g_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"log show --predicate 'processImagePath contains \"openclaw\" || processImagePath contains \"Node\" ' --log-logic --last 2m 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"feishu\\|oauth\\|token\\|auth\" | tail -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27807,"output":431,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59212,"cost":{"input":0.0083421,"output":0.0005172,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01071774}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774785747836,"responseId":"061847d44b51e352f640b2e683f52c5f"}}
