{"type":"message","id":"0dfc7372","parentId":"0f78d1d9","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:04:27.564Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_f7mxhrad66gy_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"awaiting_app_authorization\": true,\n  \"message\": \"已向用户发送授权引导卡片，等待用户完成授权操作。请告知用户：按照卡片提示完成授权，完成后系统将自动重试之前的操作。请等待用户完成卡片操作，不要建议其他替代方案。\",\n  \"missing_scopes\": [\n    \"contact:user.basic_profile:readonly\"\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"awaiting_app_authorization":true,"message":"已向用户发送授权引导卡片，等待用户完成授权操作。请告知用户：按照卡片提示完成授权，完成后系统将自动重试之前的操作。请等待用户完成卡片操作，不要建议其他替代方案。","missing_scopes":["contact:user.basic_profile:readonly"]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774785867557}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e4ed987","parentId":"0dfc7372","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:04:37.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the system says it's \"awaiting_app_authorization\" and it already sent the authorization card to the user. The user said they don't see it. Maybe they just need to scroll up in the chat to find it. Or maybe it was sent but they didn't notice it.\n\nWait - actually the message says \"已向用户发送授权引导卡片\" which means it was already sent. The user might just not have seen it. Let me tell the user to look more carefully in the chat - maybe scroll up or look for a message with buttons/cards from the bot.\n\nAlso, the missing scope is \"contact:user.basic_profile:readonly\" - this is needed to get user info. \n\nThe authorization card should have appeared as an interactive message with a button they can click. Let me inform the user that it's already been sent and they should look for it.","thinkingSignature":"de75b8bbfef0dbb9f1631191f71af4af489292dc6067977d28cf5c9f2103ca72"},{"type":"text","text":"\n频哥，系统说已经发过授权卡片了，可能在聊天记录里——\n\n**麻烦往上翻一翻**，找一条来自\"谢道韫\"（就是这个小助手）的消息，里面应该有个**按钮**或者**授权卡**，点一下就好了。\n\n翻到了告诉我一声 👍"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":29342,"output":238,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60554,"cost":{"input":0.008802599999999999,"output":0.0002856,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010946639999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774785867565,"responseId":"0618484b5a8a00170189eccbcd19700f"}}
