{"type":"message","id":"767ef936","parentId":"39102a2f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:32:56.803Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: 2 files]\n[media attached 1/2: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg]\n[media attached 2/2: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3b70614c-2f83-479d-946e-675e1daff1d9.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3b70614c-2f83-479d-946e-675e1daff1d9.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 20:32:55 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a5f198a4a0c4ce1ec5cea848f, post, 2 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a5f198a4a0c4ce1ec5cea848f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 20:32 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3b70614c-2f83-479d-946e-675e1daff1d9.jpg\n这次结合两张图片，检查一下big world部分的填空题"}],"timestamp":1774787576798}}
{"type":"message","id":"eae1a591","parentId":"767ef936","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:33:12.208Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the \"Big World\" fill-in-the-blank questions from the two images. Let me identify what questions are being asked and what the student's answers are. From the earlier recognition, the \"Big World\" section had reading comprehension questions with 4 annotations (①, ②, ③, ④). But the user specifically says \"填空题\" (fill-in-the-blank questions) about the Big World part.\n\nWait, looking at the previous recognition, the second image contained both the fill-in-the-blank exercise AND the Big World reading comprehension. The user might be referring to questions about the Big World article specifically.\n\nLet me re-read the images carefully.","thinkingSignature":"bd2a40b1658ecd4622f64c06cca2203dae708f9257ea5b2956d193fbe343c2b6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0g6r1o8pzjim_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请仔细识别这张图片中关于Big World电影的所有内容，特别是任何填空题或阅读理解题目，以及学生的答案。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0g6r1o8pzjim_2","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请仔细识别这张图片中关于Big World电影的所有内容，特别是任何填空题或阅读理解题目，以及学生的答案。这是上一张图片的延续。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3b70614c-2f83-479d-946e-675e1daff1d9.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":323,"cacheRead":67408,"cacheWrite":791,"totalTokens":68649,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0003876,"cacheRead":0.00404448,"cacheWrite":0.000296625,"total":0.004766805}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774787576808,"responseId":"06184ef9b837404c3605ed526e78531b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f1b221db","parentId":"eae1a591","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:33:33.873Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0g6r1o8pzjim_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示了一项英语短文填空（短文填空）练习。题目要求从给出的词汇库中选择合适的单词，并以正确的形式填入短文中。\n\n以下是详细的内容识别：\n\n### **1. 备选词汇库 (Word Bank)**\n这些单词位于图片顶部的方框内：\n*   appear\n*   character\n*   cross\n*   discuss\n*   describe\n*   draw\n*   harm\n*   medicine\n*   mix\n*   popular\n*   usual\n*   strict\n\n---\n\n### **2. 短文内容与填空 (Text and Blanks)**\n短文主题是关于中国社交媒体上的“抽象企鹅”趋势。以下是短文的文字内容，其中加粗的部分是学生填写的答案：\n\n**短文内容：**\n“In recent months, a special trend becomes very popular on Chinese social media—the \"abstract penguin\". This popular **1. character**, who comes from overseas 3D animations, wears sunglasses and has a big yellow mouth. With its abstract style, it quickly **2. drew** people's attention and became one of their favourite figures online.\n\nWhat makes the penguin so popular is its **3. mixture** of a funny look and a cute style. **4. Usually** (此处学生填的是 Usually，但在该语境下，结合备选词 strict，更标准的用法应为 Strictly) speaking, it's not the cutest design, but that explains why it becomes so popular. People say they love its \"imperfect **5. appearance**\".”\n\n---\n\n### **3. 学生填写的答案汇总**\n根据图片中学生手写的字迹，其填入的内容如下：\n\n1.  **character** (对应词库：character) —— 意为“角色”。\n2.  **drew** (对应词库：draw，使用了过去式) —— 意为“吸引了（注意）”。\n3.  **mixture** (对应词库：mix，使用了名词形式) —— 意为“混合体”。\n4.  **Usually** (对应词库：usual，使用了副词形式) —— 意为“通常”。*（注：从语法和搭配上讲，词库中的 \"strict\" 变成 \"Strictly speaking\" 也是常见搭配，但学生此处写的是 Usually）*。\n5.  **appearance** (对应词库：appear，使用了名词形式) —— 意为“外观”。\n\n**特别提示：** 图片中并未出现关于“Big World”电影的文字表述。短文提到的是一个源自“海外3D动画”的“抽象企鹅”形象。这个形象在网络上常被称为“Pingu”（企鹅家族）的抽象变体。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774787613867}}
{"type":"message","id":"4d631637","parentId":"f1b221db","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:33:38.629Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0g6r1o8pzjim_2","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"根据您提供的图片，以下是关于电影《Big World》的相关内容、阅读理解题目及学生的答案汇总：\n\n### 一、 文章内容摘要（关于电影《Big World》）\n\n*   **基本信息：** 电影名为《Big World》，由年轻演员易烊千玺（Jackson Yee）主演。\n*   **故事背景：** 讲述了患有脑瘫的青少年刘春和（Liu Chunhe）在面临身体挑战的同时，努力实现梦想的励志故事。\n*   **主要情节：**\n    *   刘春和帮助奶奶实现舞台表演梦想。\n    *   改善与母亲的关系。\n    *   努力学习成为一名教师。\n*   **电影主旨：** 电影不侧重于悲伤，而是强调刘春和过上正常生活的坚强意志。\n*   **社会意义：** 呼吁尊重每个人（即使身患重病），鼓励人们关注内在力量，通过他人的视角看世界，改变对不同人群的看法。\n*   **演员成就：** 易烊千玺凭借此片获得2025年第38届金鸡奖最佳男主角奖，成为首位获此殊荣的“00后”演员。\n\n---\n\n### 二、 填空题目及学生答案（表格部分）\n\n这部分要求根据上文内容完成关于电影《Big World》的结构图/表格。\n\n| 类别 | 题目/要点内容 | 学生填写的答案 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1. 总体评价/成就** | **The (1) of it:** | **achievements** (成就) |\n| | * 深度感动了全中国人民。 | |\n| | * 截至2025年，它使易烊千玺成为(2)最佳男主角奖获得者。 | **first born after 2000** (首位00后) |\n| **2. 讲述的故事** | **The story it tells:** | |\n| | * 讲述了刘春和面对许多(3)挑战，努力实现梦想的故事。 | **physical** (身体上的) |\n| | * 帮助奶奶圆梦，改善母子关系，努力当老师。 | |\n| | * (4)关注悲伤，它强调了刘春和过正常生活的坚强意志。 | **Instead of** (而不是/代替) |\n| **3. 电影的意义** | **The meaning of it:** | |\n| | * 明确显示每个人都应获得尊重，(5)他们是否有重病。 | **whether** (无论) |\n| | * 表明电影如何帮助创造一个更(6)的社会，并改变人们看差异的方式。 | **encouragement** (鼓励/鼓舞) |\n\n**注：**\n*   关于第6个空，学生填写的单词是 **\"encouragement\"**（名词），虽然在语法上放入句子 \"a more encouragement society\" 不太通顺（通常应为形容词如 *inclusive*, *understanding* 或 *encouraging*），但这确实是图中学生书写的答案。\n*   易烊千玺现实中凭借《奇迹·笨小孩》等作品多次入围奖项，此文章内容结合了现实与虚构（如2025年的金鸡奖）。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/3b70614c-2f83-479d-946e-675e1daff1d9.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774787618619}}
{"type":"message","id":"50388f42","parentId":"4d631637","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:34:00.123Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the information about the Big World fill-in-the-blank questions. Let me analyze the student's answers:\n\nTable with questions about Big World:\n\n1. The (1) of it → achievements ✓\n2. ...使易烊千玺成为(2)最佳男主角奖获得者 → **first born after 2000** \n3. 面对许多(3)挑战 → **physical** ✓\n4. (4)关注悲伤，它强调了... → **Instead of** ✓\n5. (5)他们是否有重病 → **whether** ✓\n\n\n6. 创造一个更(6)的社会 → **encouragement**\n\nFor the sixth question, the student wrote \"encouragement\" when the context calls for an adjective to describe what kind of society we're creating. The sentence structure requires \"a more _____ society,\" so the answer should be an adjective like \"encouraging\" rather than the noun form provided.\n\nActually, rethinking this—if the intended phrase is \"a more encouragement society,\" that's grammatically awkward. The more natural phrasing would use the adjective \"encouraging\" to mean a society that encourages, or possibly \"inclusive\" if that was the original target. The student's use of the noun form here suggests they may have misunderstood what grammatical form was needed, or there's something unusual about how the original exercise was structured.\n\nLooking back at the five completed answers though, I should really focus on checking those first rather than speculating about question 6. The user specifically asked me to review the Big World fill-in-the-blank questions, so let me work through what I can verify from the provided answers. I'm noticing the student wrote \"encouragement\" for question 6, but that doesn't fit grammatically—you'd need an adjective like \"encouraging\" to describe what kind of society this creates. The answer key shows \"encouragement\" though, which suggests either the original text expects the noun form in a different construction, or there's a mismatch between what was taught and what the student wrote. I should point out this discrepancy and note that based on standard English, an adjective would be the grammatically correct choice here.","thinkingSignature":"04e5b574e0128ddc6ea72aeb508a3bfb0b34311eee567637e8cc6426be547537"},{"type":"text","text":"看到了！这是Big World阅读的**表格填空**，让我逐题核对：\n\n| 题号 | 学生答案 | 正确答案？ | 分析 |\n|------|---------|-----------|------|\n| 1 | achievements | ✅ | \"The achievements of it\" ✓ |\n| 2 | first born after 2000 | ✅ | 首位00后 ✓ |\n| 3 | physical | ✅ | \"physical challenges\" ✓ |\n| 4 | Instead of | ✅ | \"Instead of focusing on sadness\" ✓ |\n| 5 | whether | ✅ | \"whether they are seriously ill\" ✓ |\n| 6 | encouragement | ⚠️ 存疑 | \"a more encouragement society\" 语法上应用形容词 **encouraging** |\n\n---\n\n**第6题有问题**——\"a more encouragement society\" 语法不对，应该是 \"a more **encouraging** society\"（形容词）。\n\n其余5题都对 🎉\n\n---\n\n需要把第6题录入错题本吗？📒"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38854,"output":642,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70470,"cost":{"input":0.0116562,"output":0.0007704,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014285039999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774787618630,"responseId":"06184f226fb097e378b4c9792bbe8746"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3186a39e","parentId":"50388f42","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:39:00.829Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 20:38:59 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a598fce0a0c2ad3d16af9876d]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a598fce0a0c2ad3d16af9876d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 20:38 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n第2题也存疑，也计入错题本吧"}],"timestamp":1774787940824}}
{"type":"message","id":"bbf26d67","parentId":"3186a39e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:39:20.139Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says question 2 is also wrong and wants it recorded. But wait - earlier AI said question 2 was \"first born after 2000\" which was marked as correct. Let me think about what the correct answer should be.\n\nThe sentence was: \"截至2025年，它使易烊千玺成为(2)最佳男主角奖获得者。\"\n\nSo the blank is about what Jackson Yee became: \"the ___ Best Actor award winner\"\n\nWait - actually the grammar might be \"the first ___ to win Best Actor\" or something like that. Let me re-read the earlier AI output more carefully.\n\nActually looking at the AI analysis again:\n- 题2: \"截至2025年，它使易烊千玺成为(2)最佳男主角奖获得者。\" - \"first born after 2000\"\n  \nWait, this doesn't make grammatical sense as \"first born after 2000 to receive Best Actor award\". The student wrote \"first born after 2000\" which is about when they were born, not about getting the award.\n \nLooking at the context more carefully - Jackson Yee was born in 2000 (November 28, 2000), so he's literally \"born in 2000.\" But the sentence structure \"成为(2)最佳男主角奖获得者\" suggests the blank should fit as \"the first [person born after 2000] to win Best Actor\" - which is actually what the student wrote and it does make sense, though it's awkwardly phrased.\n\nActually, rethinking this - the real issue might be that \"first born after 2000\" isn't quite right grammatically. The standard phrasing would be \"首位出生于2000年以后的\" or \"第一位出生于2000年以后的演员\" to receive Best Actor. The student's answer \"first born after 2000\" is missing the classifier and the word for \"person\" - it should be \"the first person born after 2000\" to win Best Actor, not just \"first born after 2000\" as a standalone phrase.\n\nSo the answer needed to be phrased differently to properly fit the sentence structure as a modifier for the award winner.","thinkingSignature":"c82da47ed309e636fc64272b7fe8f984f4d76a26f282e8eeadc1fedaec5bbc2c"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，两道都录：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_of97iuxdtefg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b7491007-cf37-43e5-8502-58e7a0786ac8.jpg /tmp/big_world.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":507,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":70040,"totalTokens":70674,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0006083999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.026265,"total":0.0269115}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774787940835,"responseId":"061850651f54bdfa22b6670db286a471"}}
